@TinaHuang1: Great video. 
Question: For someone with no coding experience, can you recommended a path (syllabus/plan) for obtaining foundational coding knowledge/skills that enable me to effectively use the tools covered in this video?  
I'm asking because I know if I just "jumped in" I'd run across literally thousands of debugging errors and I'd spend 98% (or more) of my time just throwing stuff at a wall and seeing what sicks.
